{
    "title": "Family Dollar",
    "description": "Get ready to do more with the Family Dollar app! Enjoy saving up to $500 a week with Smart Coupons, personalized content and offers, easy coupon clipping, tracking your savings, and more. It\u2019s easy, fun, and free!\r\n\r\nThe Family Dollar app offers you more ways to shop smarter and save more than ever before. Did you know you can save up to $500 every week with Smart Coupons? All it takes is clipping coupons and redeeming in store! With one-click clipping directly from our ads, special coupon events, personalized offers, and more, each week brings new ways to spend less and save more on your favorite brands and everyday essentials. You can now also clip coupons directly from our ads and books, making Smart Coupons that much easier.\r\n\r\nLooking for hot deals while shopping in store? Using the barcode scanner in your app, you can scan product barcodes to check for coupons on the items you\u2019re interested in. With a basket in one hand and the app in the other, it\u2019s easy to scan, clip, and save on every shopping trip. New deals and hot offers await you at every week, season, and occasion\u2014the possibilities to save are endless!\r\n\r\nReady to cash in your clipped coupons for savings? It\u2019s easy to redeem at checkout. All you do is scan your unique barcode within the app and watch your lifetime savings grow\u2014all at your fingertips. We celebrate when you save!\r\nIn addition to more ways to shop and save, the new Family Dollar app offers you a tailored experience with products and offers personalized for you. We offer special savings for coupon events and occasions throughout the year, so make sure you check your app regularly for hot offers, seasonal savings, and personalized coupons!\r\n\r\nReady to get started? Download to start clipping, saving, and doing more with the new Family Dollar app!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get ready to do more with the Family Dollar app! Enjoy saving up to $500 a week with Smart Coupons, personalized content and offers, easy coupon clipping, tracking your savings, and more. It\u2019s easy, fun, and free!<br><br>The Family Dollar app offers you more ways to shop smarter and save more than ever before. Did you know you can save up to $500 every week with Smart Coupons? All it takes is clipping coupons and redeeming in store! With one-click clipping directly from our ads, special coupon events, personalized offers, and more, each week brings new ways to spend less and save more on your favorite brands and everyday essentials. You can now also clip coupons directly from our ads and books, making Smart Coupons that much easier.<br><br>Looking for hot deals while shopping in store? Using the barcode scanner in your app, you can scan product barcodes to check for coupons on the items you\u2019re interested in. With a basket in one hand and the app in the other, it\u2019s easy to scan, clip, and save on every shopping trip. New deals and hot offers await you at every week, season, and occasion\u2014the possibilities to save are endless!<br><br>Ready to cash in your clipped coupons for savings? It\u2019s easy to redeem at checkout. All you do is scan your unique barcode within the app and watch your lifetime savings grow\u2014all at your fingertips. We celebrate when you save!<br>In addition to more ways to shop and save, the new Family Dollar app offers you a tailored experience with products and offers personalized for you. We offer special savings for coupon events and occasions throughout the year, so make sure you check your app regularly for hot offers, seasonal savings, and personalized coupons!<br><br>Ready to get started? Download to start clipping, saving, and doing more with the new Family Dollar app!",
